Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:10:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 32/50] DRM over IOKit: IOAccelNMXDRMClient for sandboxed
 processes (WindowServer)

WindowServer's sandbox opens /dev/dri/renderD128 read-only but denies every ioctl on a device file; it may
open IOKit user clients named IOAccel*. NMXGPU::newUserClient type 'NMXD' opens the render node through the
devfs entry points; selector 0 runs one ioctl on it in the caller's context. libdrm's drmNmxIoctl switches
an fd to it on EPERM.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DP5dwQG4pUvK6V9ftNsQRB
